    <node id="&quot;WOW AIR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wow Air is an airline based in Iceland, hoping for a last-minute sale or merger with a higher-profile airline in March 2019, operating with more than 100 aircraft in the UK, Denmark, and Germany."</data>
